  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.9/client-server-api/#post_matrixclientv3joinroomidoralias\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe *Third-party Signed* object, used for redeeming a 3PID invite, contains a `signatures` field.\r\nBut it doesn't say who the signatures are supposed to be *from*.\r\n\r\nIt also doesn't say why the signatures are needed, which can help with understanding.",
